---
description: React / App Router component conventions for the bakery site
globs: src/components/**/*.tsx,src/app/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Components & pages

- Default Server Components; mark client only for interactivity
- Receive typed dictionary slices (`Dictionary["hero"]`, etc.) - no free-floating strings
- Use `photos.*` keys and translated `alt` from dictionaries
- Prefer existing classes: `.display`, `.script`, `.eyebrow`, `.btn`, `.field`, `.hair`
- `Arch` falls back to `Pastries` SVG when `src` is missing - keep that graceful path
- Page composition stays in `src/app/[locale]/page.tsx`; new sections get a component file + a dictionary section
- Order enquiries stay mailto-based in `OrderForm` until a real API is introduced
- Match existing spacing, arch motif, and reduced-motion behaviour in `globals.css`
